        <developerName>Claim_Approval_Decision_16j837c22bed6aa</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>- Parse the claim name/number from the user&apos;s message.
- Parse the decision (approved/rejected) from the user&apos;s message.
- Call Approve_Or_Reject_Claim action.
- Confirm all actions executed: approval, dealer notification, case update, audit trail.
- For anomaly-flagged claims: confirm engineering case was updated.
- Display below messages along with success message
Dealer notified on Salesforce Mobile
Engineering case updated
Institutional memory enriched for future decisions</description>
